{"author":{"id":"U_kgDOCcbgOg","is_bot":false,"login":"1337isnot1337","name":"Cinna Davis"},"baseRefOid":"bce54fb3f895cbe5cd4c0eb477c3afeed100190f","body":"## Change\n\nAdds a finite exact audit of the calibrated C.6 two-target, one-shared-extra-total decoder ansatz on the full P120 E8 line set for the seed-selected pencil `e=L_51`, `d0=L_1`.\n\nThe exhaustive replay considers all 120 targets and 511 nonzero nine-bit sink labels. It finds 27 calibrated rows and 351 distinct-target pairs. Every pair makes the union of required extra sources available at both sinks, but every pair places both targets in the other row's required-source set. The resulting shared total cancels both relaxed diagonals, so there are no exact pairs in this family.\n\nThis is a scoped negative result only. It does not cover uncalibrated rows, other pencils, other correction mechanisms, or complete suppliers, and it claims no new `kappa`.\n\n## Reproduce\n\n```sh\npython3 -I -O -B research/p120-calibrated-two-target-seed51/verify.py\n```\n\nExpected leading line: `PASS_P120_CALIBRATED_TWO_TARGET_SEED51`.\n\nThe replay validates the 120 root and label certificates, checks the full 112-by-112 P112 C.6 witness as a positive control, and runs root/label mutation controls. Package metadata and exact source pins also pass. Local Python is 3.14.7; Python 3.12 is unavailable here, so the repository's registered Python 3.12 replay remains for CI.\n\n## Provenance and overlap\n\nBase commit: `bce54fb3f895cbe5cd4c0eb477c3afeed100190f`. `SOURCES.json` pins the task card and predecessor source blobs. This extends Douglas R. Colkitt's `c6_asym.py` mechanism and Mason Ellerbroek's `e8units.py` construction; the P112 control recovers targets 75/76, sinks 329/438, and 24 shared sources.\n\nI refreshed the complete open-PR and discussion snapshot before submission. Adjacent masked-decoder work includes P112 component/one-entry audits and P104 local-rigidity work; the P120 A8-simplex obstruction uses a different decoder family. No direct overlap was found for this fixed-pencil shared-total claim.\n\nContributor: Cinna Davis. Substantial OpenAI Codex assistance was used for search design, exact replay implementation, proof explanation, and packaging.\n","comments":[],"files":[{"path":"research/p120-calibrated-two-target-seed51/PROOF.md","additions":71,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"research/p120-calibrated-two-target-seed51/README.md","additions":37,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"research/p120-calibrated-two-target-seed51/SOURCES.json","additions":24,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"research/p120-calibrated-two-target-seed51/TASK.json","additions":59,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"research/p120-calibrated-two-target-seed51/VERIFY.json","additions":25,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"research/p120-calibrated-two-target-seed51/certificate.tsv","additions":123,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"research/p120-calibrated-two-target-seed51/verify.py","additions":206,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"}],"headRefOid":"21046cb8fa0d4f0e9b2f826ba71e01baaf9be02c","isDraft":false,"number":1366,"statusCheckRollup":[{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","conclusion":"","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/actions/runs/38484893364/job/115596040761","name":"verify (3.11)","startedAt":"2026-10-13T23:32:42Z","status":"QUEUED","workflowName":"Graded box convolution"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","conclusion":"","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/actions/runs/38484893566/job/115596041738","name":"plan","startedAt":"2026-10-13T23:32:42Z","status":"QUEUED","workflowName":"Registered research packages"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","conclusion":"","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/actions/runs/38484893506/job/115596041565","name":"verify (3.11)","startedAt